      "id": "p11:b4:l3:s0-2",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        4,
        3,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "confirmed the existence of this bright spot, now known as Poisson’s spot or Arago’s spot. This result provided strong",
      "point": [
